WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Gripping his blade tightly, Yuta speaks up&nbsp;
and tells the group that he’s going to go join&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.940
the battle to help Gojo. Not pleased to hear&nbsp;
this as he stated he’d be the first to leave,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:17.520
Kashimo sparks up his cursed energy and warns Yuta&nbsp;
to not interfere as its not him who’ll fight next.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.300
Seeing his boys cursed energy&nbsp;
flare up, Hakari asks Yuta to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.440
calm down &amp; says Gojo had initially asked&nbsp;
them to tag in when he starts to lose the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:31.260
battle or gets overwhelmed. But Yuta rebukes&nbsp;
staying since Sukuna's DE is now disabled,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.560
he can help Gojo by handling&nbsp;
the two shikigamis with Rika.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:40.260
Speaking up, Maki tells Kashimo to not forget his&nbsp;
overall role in this battle. If he's defeated then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.520
some of there back up insurance will be gone. Yuta&nbsp;
is just like but bruh, if we just go for it now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.420
and take this gamble and win against Sukuna,&nbsp;
then the insurance won't be needed at all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.280
Probably just eager to test his new body swapping&nbsp;
ability, Yuji takes Yuta's side &amp; encourages him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.240
to go for it. I love how this back up plan&nbsp;
of theirs really hasn't even been discussed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:07.140
like we know Kashimo said he’s gonna go&nbsp;
next. But was this spoken about beforehand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:10.860
with Gojo? Yuta made it seem like they’ve all&nbsp;
had this chat in the days before this battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:17.520
so im guessing there is an underlying plan&nbsp;
that our team does have. Anyways Anyways.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:22.020
They all think that because Sukuna isn't able to&nbsp;
give his everything &amp; Gojo is at his best when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:25.620
he doesn't need to worry about others, this&nbsp;
setup they’re currently in has the highest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.880
probability of winning. Getting slightly&nbsp;
bummed out with this both Yuji and Yuta&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.080
sulk after realizing that they’re probably just&nbsp;
going to be a hinderance if they enter. Pulling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.580
them back to reality though, Kashimo tells them&nbsp;
thats not exactly true. At the end of the day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.240
this is Gojo's fight and it would just&nbsp;
be lame as hell if they interfered.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:47.760
Hakari himself suspects that Sukuna might have a&nbsp;
Trump Card &amp; is preserving it for later. So if the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:52.500
sorcerers act to quickly and reveal their hand,&nbsp;
Sukuna might end up using that trap card on them.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:58.620
Back inside of Shinjuku the two massive&nbsp;
Shikigami attack Gojo in combination,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:04.140
however Gojo evades the attacks with ease &amp;&nbsp;
lands his own counterattack black flash. Jumping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:08.520
back its shown that Agito wasn't even fazed by&nbsp;
the hit and instead sends its tail to attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.840
which is infact a miniature version of the great&nbsp;
serpent proving that this beast was probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:17.280
made up of even more Shikigami than originally&nbsp;
thought. Ripping off the head of the serpent tail,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.320
Gojo watches as Mahoraga quickly pushes the&nbsp;
other Shikigami aside to protect it as it heals.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:26.700
Pondering on this new beast some more,&nbsp;
Gojo thinks that Agito is most likely made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.600
up of 'Nue', which firstly inherited&nbsp;
the 'Great Serpent', then the 'Mourn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.620
Tiger' &amp; 'Round Deer'!! Still none of that&nbsp;
even matters in the larger scheme of things,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:40.080
since Agito isn't adapted to Limitless like&nbsp;
Mahoraga, Gojo plans to destroy it in one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:45.240
shot. Stepping away again for one second,&nbsp;
another random reveal I almost missed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:51.120
but what is this Mourn Tiger. Surely thats the&nbsp;
10th Shikigami from the Ten Shadows technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.680
that we haven't seen yet? The lines across&nbsp;
Agito’s chest could resemble the Tigers markings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:03.270
love to know what you all think and if we’ll ever&nbsp;
get an explanation on this Shikigami later on.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:06.480
Placing his blade on the floor,&nbsp;
Mahoraga flicks it at Gojo causing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:10.140
a line of rubble to get thrown up into his&nbsp;
face. Blocking the rocks with his infinity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.880
Gojo then proceeds to dodge out of the way of&nbsp;
the Shikigami’s follow up attack. Continuing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.000
Dad then launches a fat head kick&nbsp;
that pushes the creature back.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.740
Turning around, Gojo quickly activates his&nbsp;
infinity and brings the 2nd Shikigami in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:28.320
closer. Having seen Agito use RCT to heal its&nbsp;
tail before, Gojo realizes itl be troublesome&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:32.400
if it also heals Sukuna during battle,&nbsp;
so his plan is to firstly deal with it.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.080
Elsewhere inside of his dank shadowy world,&nbsp;
Sukuna starts creating a plan to not let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:41.340
Gojo use his prolific hollow purple.&nbsp;
He knows that last time Gojo used it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:45.480
the attack was amped up to 120%,&nbsp;
still he was able to take it head&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.780
on with somewhat minimal damage since it&nbsp;
was coming from such a large distance.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:53.160
However due to everything thats happened&nbsp;
since then, if Dad does hit him with even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:58.620
a 100% hollow purple right now, then it will&nbsp;
be fatal. Knowing that Mahoraga wasn't showing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:03.360
him everything. Sukuna speaks up and asks his&nbsp;
Shikigami how long its going to make him wait.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:08.940
He’s not dumb and knows its no longer MEGUMI’S&nbsp;
SHADOW, so demands that it show him what its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:13.800
got! Following those orders, Mahoraga’s wheel&nbsp;
spins and sends forth an ability that looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:18.180
exactly like Sukuna’s dismantle which slices&nbsp;
the greatest sorcerer of todays arm right off.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:23.280
Not leaving his shadowy realm, Sukuna chuckles&nbsp;
and praises Mahoraga for its adept use of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.320
technique, while simultaneously a bunch of&nbsp;
the sorcerers all scream in pure panic. Shoko&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:32.580
personally knows that this isn't great timing&nbsp;
at all as Gojo’s healing is currently weakened.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.340
Re-emerging from his shadows&nbsp;
and taking the advantage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.780
Sukuna punches Gojo before quickly following&nbsp;
up with a wicked snap kick that sends Gojo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:43.260
directly into the path of Agito who’d&nbsp;
begun flaring up its cursed energy.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:48.060
Agito proceeds to absolutely pummel&nbsp;
Gojo’s head with a fat right hook. However&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:57.960
Gojo looking completely manic looks into its eyes&nbsp;
while creating an orb of condensed blue and tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:02.491
Agito that for a while now it wasn't worthy enough&nbsp;
to be considered an opponent in this battle.

00:05:02.491 --> 00:05:02.520
LITERALLY SCREEEEAM LIKE SSJ3

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:08.340
SMASHING HIS LEFT HAND DOWN, GOJO EFFORTLESSLY&nbsp;
THRASHES AROUND THE PATHETIC CURSE. Looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:13.200
