uselessness as he captures it completely within&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:18.720
his NEW BLUE MAXIMUM OUTPUT AND SENDS THE PATHETIC&nbsp;
CREATURE HURLING TOWARDS SUKUNA AND MAHORAGA.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:22.620
Dodging out of the blasts way, Sukuna&nbsp;
can only watch as the amalgamation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.400
