Shinjuku before it’s eventually crushed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.760
and destroyed under the pure force&nbsp;
of Gojo’s Maximum output technique.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:36.000
41 seconds later GOJO’S PURPLE HAS ALSO RIPPED&nbsp;
ITS WAY THOROUGH THE BATTLEFIELD IN SHINJUKU

